OL,3,AOpenAI slows down training after its AI
OL,4,Acarried out hack
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpenAI says it has slowed down training
OL,7,Fsome of its most advanced AI models to
OL,8,Fimprove security.
OL,10,FIn a blog post, external, the
OL,11,FChatGPT-maker said it was introducing
OL,12,Fnew measures after its AI agents
OL,13,Fautonomously bypassed safeguards and
OL,14,Fhacked the tech start-up Hugging Face.
OL,16,FIt said training would be slowed for
OL,17,Ftwo weeks while it puts the upgrades in
OL,18,Fplace.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,113,105,200,160,0,100
